1
00:01:51,425 --> 00:02:03,455
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,394 --> 00:02:08,414
No living creature was hurt
during the production of this film.

3
00:02:08,765 --> 00:02:10,164
Osman is here!

4
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,365
What would you like us to do, sir?

5
00:02:12,466 --> 00:02:14,732
Soldiers will be in defensive formation.

6
00:02:14,733 --> 00:02:16,632
What can Osman do to us Commander Mouzalon?

7
00:02:16,633 --> 00:02:18,532
You don't know Osman, Commander.

8
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:21,499
I'm sure the troops in the west
thought the same!

9
00:02:21,733 --> 00:02:25,465
I do not want arrogance!
I want victory!

10
00:02:27,666 --> 00:02:30,232
Will Osman really attack?

11
00:02:30,533 --> 00:02:32,199
Osman is not crazy.

12
00:02:32,733 --> 00:02:35,332
He would not attack such an army
before preparing.

13
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,932
But I am also not stupid.

14
00:02:38,633 --> 00:02:40,265
I will take all my precautions.

15
00:02:41,333 --> 00:02:43,299
I'll be ready when he comes.

16
00:02:46,333 --> 00:02:48,765
Come at me, Lord.
Come...

17
00:02:50,833 --> 00:02:52,965
Even our presence here frightens you.

18
00:02:53,366 --> 00:02:56,265
My Bey, when should we attack them?
What is your order?

19
00:02:56,366 --> 00:02:59,099
My Bey...
Valiants from all tribes....

20
00:02:59,733 --> 00:03:04,132
...came here to kill the Lord.
Today, this will be done if Allah permits!

21
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:08,432
They are crowded but we will attack from all sides
when our Bey orders us.

22
00:03:08,433 --> 00:03:10,593
We've been waiting for this day
for a long time, my Bey

23
00:03:10,593 --> 00:03:12,033
In the name of Allah, my Bey!

24
00:03:12,033 --> 00:03:14,732
My Bey!
Now the field is ours, huh?

25
00:03:14,966 --> 00:03:16,399
Right.

26
00:03:16,966 --> 00:03:18,499
Right.

27
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,432
-Boran.
-My Bey.

28
00:03:20,433 --> 00:03:22,432
What are Orhan and Alaeddin doing?

29
00:03:22,533 --> 00:03:23,932
Did they go to Bapheus?

30
00:03:23,933 --> 00:03:27,465
They must be settled on the left and right,
at a distance of one ell.

31
00:03:27,466 --> 00:03:32,065
My Bey, the Alps who came from tribes for the fight
settled on the left and right in...

32
00:03:32,066 --> 00:03:33,865
...Bafeus with your order.

33
00:03:34,233 --> 00:03:37,099
My Bey, most of our Alps are there.
What about us?

34
00:03:39,866 --> 00:03:42,999
We will attack as
a wolf attacks a herd, if Allah permits.

35
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,532
If Allah permits, my Bey.

36
00:03:45,066 --> 00:03:48,465
My Bey... Our number is not enough.
We'll be defeated.

37
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:52,032
That's what we want.

38
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,132
Come on, archers!

39
00:03:55,433 --> 00:03:57,965
Apparently that coward will not come here.

40
00:03:58,966 --> 00:04:00,465
Commander Mouzalon.

41
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:03,832
If you allow us,
the army will break the formation.

42
00:04:05,133 --> 00:04:07,799
I told you that you don't know Osman,
Commander.

43
00:04:09,233 --> 00:04:11,932
Anything can happen anytime.

44
00:04:13,166 --> 00:04:14,999
The army came here to fight.

45
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:19,232
-They will fight.
-Osman does not have the courage to att...

46
00:04:21,433 --> 00:04:23,199
You idiot!

47
00:04:23,833 --> 00:04:26,299
Wall of shield!

48
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:36,599
O Truth!
(One of the names of Allah: Haqq)

49
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:45,582
O Truth!

50
00:04:49,366 --> 00:04:52,165
O Truth!

51
00:04:53,933 --> 00:04:55,932
Shoot them!

52
00:04:59,533 --> 00:05:02,132
O Truth!

53
00:05:07,833 --> 00:05:10,332
Come at me, Osman.

54
00:05:10,633 --> 00:05:12,165
Come..

55
00:07:30,833 --> 00:07:33,465
What is your order, Commander Mouzalon?

56
00:07:33,466 --> 00:07:36,199
They are attacking from all sides.

57
00:07:37,966 --> 00:07:39,499
But they are weak.

58
00:07:41,533 --> 00:07:44,832
This army can not be defeated,
Commander Silvanus.

59
00:07:45,466 --> 00:07:47,199
A little bit more patience.

60
00:07:48,166 --> 00:07:51,199
The only thing that making them
resist right now..

61
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,499
...is their faith.

62
00:07:54,566 --> 00:07:56,332
They will lose it soon.

63
00:08:55,533 --> 00:08:58,065
Allah is the greatest!

64
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,832
Shield wall!

65
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:48,732
Attack!

66
00:11:41,033 --> 00:11:44,365
Come on!
Come to me!

67
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:30,699
What will you do now, Osman?

68
00:13:32,733 --> 00:13:34,965
The shepherd's fate...

69
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,832
...is to be defeated by Byzantine.

70
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:41,265
Wolves will tear apart the heartless lions.

71
00:13:42,233 --> 00:13:45,632
Be patient, Lord.
Be patient!

72
00:14:15,133 --> 00:14:16,865
Alps.

73
00:14:17,700 --> 00:14:19,532
Retreat!

74
00:14:20,133 --> 00:14:22,499
Falling back!

75
00:14:29,166 --> 00:14:30,932
I will show you.

76
00:14:32,333 --> 00:14:34,165
Bring the horses.

77
00:15:02,333 --> 00:15:04,265
Now they think we are defeated.

78
00:15:04,766 --> 00:15:06,799
But in the end, victory will be ours.

79
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:10,699
It is our turn now.
We will fall back to Bapheus.

80
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:14,065
Orhan Bey and Alaeddin Bey..

81
00:15:14,233 --> 00:15:16,199
...must be settled now, right Bey?

82
00:15:16,466 --> 00:15:17,665
True.

83
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,832
Let us retreat to our point...

84
00:15:20,166 --> 00:15:22,465
...then we will weaken them with arrows.

85
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,232
Then, victory is ours.

86
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:29,732
Those who try to capture Turks' homeland
will lose their head quick.

87
00:15:29,733 --> 00:15:31,965
Of course. That's right.

88
00:15:34,066 --> 00:15:37,232
Konur, you will continue to retreat with valiants.

89
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:41,832
-They'll think we are perished, they'll follow us.
-As you command, Bey.

90
00:15:43,066 --> 00:15:46,265
Aktemur, you will head left.

91
00:15:46,533 --> 00:15:48,165
As you command, Bey.

92
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:53,732
Bala and others,
you will come after us.

93
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:58,699
We will not look back until Bapheus.

94
00:15:59,700 --> 00:16:01,832
Let us go.

95
00:16:18,966 --> 00:16:20,599
Stop!

96
00:16:24,633 --> 00:16:26,699
This could be a trap of Osman's.

97
00:16:26,866 --> 00:16:29,532
The tracks divide here, Commander Mouzalon.

98
00:16:29,533 --> 00:16:31,665
Doesn't matter, we will not.

99
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:35,099
If Osman is up to some ambush..

100
00:16:35,566 --> 00:16:38,232
The army must be big enough to handle it.

101
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:41,099
Sir, he was hurt.

102
00:16:41,466 --> 00:16:43,299
He left without looking back.

103
00:16:43,666 --> 00:16:45,199
You still think that?

104
00:16:47,133 --> 00:16:49,432
I will not underestimate Osman again.

105
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:52,632
They army will go this way..

106
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:57,432
In one piece.

107
00:17:18,433 --> 00:17:20,098
O Truth!

108
00:17:20,633 --> 00:17:22,932
O Truth!

109
00:17:28,099 --> 00:17:29,932
O Truth!

110
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:37,632
O Truth!

111
00:18:05,466 --> 00:18:09,932
Allah is the greatest!

112
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,165
Lord.

113
00:18:57,733 --> 00:19:00,032
You cannot escape your end, Osman.

114
00:19:01,333 --> 00:19:03,765
That means you cannot escape me!

115
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:06,199
No.

116
00:19:07,100 --> 00:19:09,965
My army is the strongest army of Byzantium.

117
00:19:10,666 --> 00:19:12,032
None of your games...

118
00:19:12,566 --> 00:19:15,399
...will be enough to defeat it.

119
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:19,765
Break those hands that shot us arrows!

120
00:19:20,233 --> 00:19:23,599
Tear those eyes that targeted Byzantium!

121
00:19:24,566 --> 00:19:26,299
My soldiers!

122
00:19:26,566 --> 00:19:29,032
The victory shall be ours today!

123
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:31,799
The arrows will always be on your chests.

124
00:19:32,566 --> 00:19:35,932
Our eyes will always
be looking towards your lands!

125
00:19:37,066 --> 00:19:39,832
The victory will always belong to Turks!

126
00:19:40,133 --> 00:19:43,165
Alps, attack!

127
00:21:05,633 --> 00:21:07,999
Why are you so furious, Esrigun Hatun?

128
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:10,332
I thought the only traitor was Nayman.

129
00:21:10,366 --> 00:21:12,932
But it seems the world is full of traitors, Bala Hatun.

130
00:21:12,933 --> 00:21:15,599
We told you, the order is
different here in these lands.

131
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,499
Come on!

132
00:21:29,466 --> 00:21:31,065
Esrigun!

133
00:21:37,766 --> 00:21:38,932
Come on!

134
00:23:30,700 --> 00:23:34,732
When the wolves arrive at the field,
the jackals run away!

135
00:23:39,900 --> 00:23:41,765
The lion does not fit in the cage,

136
00:23:42,333 --> 00:23:46,132
it tears it up, pierce them, pierce them!

137
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:58,632
No one can threaten Kayi,

138
00:24:58,733 --> 00:25:03,099
Allah is the greatest! Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

139
00:25:15,866 --> 00:25:17,632
Valens.

140
00:25:23,133 --> 00:25:24,899
You will understand.

141
00:25:25,700 --> 00:25:27,965
You will understand that

142
00:25:28,533 --> 00:25:30,132
Byzantium will destroy you.

143
00:25:30,300 --> 00:25:33,765
We understand power, come on and teach me.

144
00:26:00,566 --> 00:26:04,599
You will understand that
we will always beat Byzantium!

145
00:26:05,666 --> 00:26:07,432
You're dreaming, Osman.

146
00:26:09,800 --> 00:26:12,165
Byzantium does not lose.

147
00:26:12,500 --> 00:26:15,132
When this battle is over and you lose your head,

148
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:19,732
you will understand that Byzantium
can lose just like everyone else.

149
00:27:22,566 --> 00:27:25,932
-We're going back to Bursa.
-We can still win.

150
00:27:28,100 --> 00:27:32,032
I know which battle can be won
and which will be lost.

151
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,365
We're going back.

152
00:27:45,266 --> 00:27:47,132
I will come back Osman!

153
00:27:51,366 --> 00:27:55,665
You will hit once, and I will come back
to hit a thousand times.

154
00:27:56,433 --> 00:27:57,832
Osman!

155
00:28:04,433 --> 00:28:08,199
Run anywhere you want,
you will not be able to run away from me.

156
00:28:10,166 --> 00:28:12,865
He cannot run anywhere father!

157
00:28:21,233 --> 00:28:22,532
Come on!

158
00:28:24,233 --> 00:28:26,365
No, Orhan!

159
00:28:31,466 --> 00:28:35,065
Baysungur, Turahan go after Orhan!

160
00:28:47,233 --> 00:28:50,765
You cannot enter the Turkish lands
so easily, Commander.

161
00:28:50,900 --> 00:28:53,432
This is our land, silly!

162
00:28:54,333 --> 00:28:56,999
For now, come here.

163
00:29:05,700 --> 00:29:07,099
Come here.

164
00:29:08,733 --> 00:29:11,199
Come here, come.

165
00:29:17,833 --> 00:29:19,132
Come here.

166
00:29:56,033 --> 00:29:57,365
So,

167
00:29:57,700 --> 00:30:00,832
the lands you came to shed our blood

168
00:30:01,566 --> 00:30:03,565
will be your grave.

169
00:30:03,966 --> 00:30:07,499
Then we will get into the
same ground together, Osman.

170
00:30:07,866 --> 00:30:09,499
But there will be a difference.

171
00:30:11,633 --> 00:30:13,532
You become carcass when you

172
00:30:13,966 --> 00:30:16,499
we become martyr when we die.

173
00:30:36,433 --> 00:30:37,499
Alps.

174
00:30:37,833 --> 00:30:40,765
Take all the treasury
in the ships they came from.

175
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:46,432
Now, we will go to Koyunhisar right away.

176
00:30:47,066 --> 00:30:50,499
-Yes my Bey!
-Yes my Bey!

177
00:30:52,066 --> 00:30:54,199
-Come on.
-Come on Alps!

178
00:31:00,100 --> 00:31:24,499
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

179
00:31:24,500 --> 00:31:27,899
We need to get over the walls
before Osman Bey arrives, come on!

180
00:31:27,933 --> 00:31:29,432
The infidel army is here!

181
00:31:30,333 --> 00:31:33,365
We have to take this citadel, come on!

182
00:31:34,166 --> 00:31:39,999
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

183
00:32:14,833 --> 00:32:17,532
Soldiers! Attack!

184
00:32:17,933 --> 00:32:20,599
Leo. We are going back to Bursa!

185
00:32:39,866 --> 00:32:42,332
Boran Bey! Turahan!

186
00:32:59,033 --> 00:33:00,899
Your life is yours today.

187
00:33:01,933 --> 00:33:05,232
When the right time comes
I'll take both your life and Bursa.

188
00:33:08,333 --> 00:33:10,932
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

189
00:33:11,300 --> 00:33:19,632
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

190
00:33:19,733 --> 00:33:22,032
Allah is eternal! Allah is right!
We can't break it!

191
00:33:22,100 --> 00:33:24,699
Brother, either we conquer this castle...

192
00:33:24,766 --> 00:33:27,032
...or we will become martyrs here!
Come on!

193
00:33:27,133 --> 00:33:30,132
We will not let Osman Bey down, my brother!

194
00:33:30,300 --> 00:33:32,665
Come on!

195
00:33:32,766 --> 00:33:34,899
Allah is the greatest!

196
00:33:35,500 --> 00:33:38,332
Osman died when fighting against our armies!

197
00:33:42,233 --> 00:33:45,832
Our army will be here soon!
You will all die!

198
00:33:48,766 --> 00:33:51,265
Do not bow down, Alps! Don't!

199
00:33:51,500 --> 00:33:54,999
Hit stronger! Stronger!
Come on! We will not return!

200
00:33:55,300 --> 00:33:57,799
The army is coming, my Bey! Let's go back!

201
00:33:58,166 --> 00:34:00,099
We will not return!

202
00:34:00,333 --> 00:34:03,565
This is the hill of archers today!
Harder!

203
00:34:04,033 --> 00:34:06,765
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

204
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:09,732
Allah is eternal! Allah is right!
Ignore the infidels!

205
00:34:09,733 --> 00:34:17,632
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

206
00:34:18,565 --> 00:34:20,732
We arrived, Alps!

207
00:34:22,333 --> 00:34:24,032
Thank you Beys!

208
00:34:24,699 --> 00:34:25,465
Live long!

209
00:34:25,766 --> 00:34:28,465
Come on Alps!

210
00:34:28,632 --> 00:34:31,299
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

211
00:34:31,466 --> 00:34:34,199
O Allah!

212
00:34:34,366 --> 00:34:37,532
Allah is eternal!
Allah is right!

213
00:34:37,632 --> 00:34:41,364
Muslims started fighting!
Infidels will get lost!

214
00:34:41,632 --> 00:34:44,764
The flag of Islam will be planted everywhere!

215
00:34:44,833 --> 00:34:47,899
Come on brothers!
Allah is the greatest!

216
00:34:48,065 --> 00:34:50,632
-Come on Alps!
-If their doors are made of steel...

217
00:34:50,966 --> 00:34:53,165
...we have hearts made of steel!

218
00:34:56,933 --> 00:34:59,832
Praise be!

219
00:35:00,300 --> 00:35:04,599
-O Allah! O Allah!
-We are here, Lord! We will take this castle!

220
00:35:04,900 --> 00:35:07,832
Come on! Come on Beys!

221
00:35:08,133 --> 00:35:12,732
O Allah!

222
00:35:40,933 --> 00:35:42,432
That dog.

223
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:44,365
Mouzalon.

224
00:35:51,033 --> 00:35:53,299
In the name of Allah,
the most merciful, the most compassionate.

225
00:35:56,366 --> 00:35:59,565
I will take both your life and Bursa!

226
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,565
I will.

227
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:04,499
He was waiting for us to come after, Orhan Bey.

228
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:09,299
He was indeed, and he will wait more.

229
00:36:10,900 --> 00:36:13,099
I will take that castle..

230
00:36:13,333 --> 00:36:15,432
And that borrowed throne of his.

231
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:18,165
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

232
00:36:21,933 --> 00:36:25,099
Innkeeper, bring us bulghur with meat.

233
00:36:29,766 --> 00:36:31,465
We will stay here tonight.

234
00:36:31,833 --> 00:36:34,699
We will arrive Yenisehir first thing in the morning.

235
00:36:34,966 --> 00:36:37,065
Mouzalon expects ineptness from me.

236
00:36:37,766 --> 00:36:39,999
Expects me to act without planning.

237
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,632
However, he is wrong.

238
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:56,899
-Let me renew my ablution.
-Okay my Bey.

239
00:37:03,300 --> 00:37:04,599
Orhan Bey.

240
00:37:07,600 --> 00:37:09,699
You are Orhan Bey, right?

241
00:37:15,966 --> 00:37:17,265
I am Irem

242
00:37:19,366 --> 00:37:21,532
I am the aide of Lady Holofira.

243
00:37:24,866 --> 00:37:26,365
She always speak of you.

244
00:37:27,133 --> 00:37:28,632
Holofira.

245
00:37:30,133 --> 00:37:32,932
Where is she now? Is she okay?

246
00:37:33,566 --> 00:37:34,865
Tell me, Hatun?

247
00:37:35,166 --> 00:37:37,165
We'll leave soon, come here.

248
00:37:44,833 --> 00:37:46,432
Holofira.

249
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:49,399
She remembers me.

250
00:37:57,433 --> 00:37:59,532
Aktemur Bey.

251
00:38:01,066 --> 00:38:04,165
What is this infidel doing here?

252
00:38:11,666 --> 00:38:13,832
Bey knows what he's doing, Bayindir Bey.

253
00:38:14,333 --> 00:38:15,965
You will find out soon.

254
00:38:19,833 --> 00:38:22,699
Make way, Osman Bey.

255
00:38:31,700 --> 00:38:33,265
Welcome.

256
00:38:39,666 --> 00:38:42,499
Now, Bey's wonder..

257
00:38:43,600 --> 00:38:46,532
What are these Christians doing here?

258
00:38:49,933 --> 00:38:50,999
And you..

259
00:38:51,566 --> 00:38:54,799
Wonder why you are here.

260
00:38:59,066 --> 00:39:01,632
Since we will live together..

261
00:39:02,233 --> 00:39:05,165
Then we will talk the principles together.

262
00:39:11,366 --> 00:39:14,265
Koyunhisar Castle is ours now.

263
00:39:14,866 --> 00:39:16,665
Now tell me.

264
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:19,299
What do you think about this.

265
00:39:29,333 --> 00:39:31,899
Of course, speech does lead to beheadings.

266
00:39:32,566 --> 00:39:34,065
However, don't worry.

267
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:37,399
We will welcome your words.

268
00:39:40,533 --> 00:39:43,799
We are grieved, Osman Bey. We are scared.

269
00:39:44,233 --> 00:39:46,999
We are scared about Koyunhisar's situation.

270
00:39:50,266 --> 00:39:51,999
Tell me.

271
00:39:53,166 --> 00:39:55,732
Why are you scared?

272
00:39:57,066 --> 00:39:58,565
You are scared of torment.

273
00:39:59,100 --> 00:40:01,032
Of injustice.

274
00:40:01,766 --> 00:40:03,299
However, know this.

275
00:40:03,966 --> 00:40:08,132
Under my banner, none of these exist.

276
00:40:11,033 --> 00:40:14,165
This council is established with merit.

277
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:16,332
Even..

278
00:40:16,633 --> 00:40:19,332
The first principle is ethics.

279
00:40:22,633 --> 00:40:25,665
We observed you in castles forts.

280
00:40:25,866 --> 00:40:27,265
Even..

281
00:40:27,666 --> 00:40:31,432
We saved Leodis, whom you scorned
because he was a shepherd.

282
00:40:31,833 --> 00:40:34,599
We told him to give us one sheep.

283
00:40:35,533 --> 00:40:37,532
We offered five times the price.

284
00:40:38,100 --> 00:40:39,399
However..

285
00:40:39,700 --> 00:40:42,132
He did not sell us.

286
00:40:42,400 --> 00:40:44,032
As the sheep's time was not yet.

287
00:40:44,566 --> 00:40:48,232
And that is why he is in this council.

288
00:40:50,766 --> 00:40:52,432
We've watched you as well.

289
00:40:52,966 --> 00:40:55,832
The most fair among you
will represent your people.

290
00:40:56,533 --> 00:40:59,832
You will talk about their problems in this council.

291
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:03,432
However, never forget this.

292
00:41:05,233 --> 00:41:07,232
If torment enters one home..

293
00:41:08,833 --> 00:41:10,565
Then law is applied.

294
00:41:11,066 --> 00:41:13,899
The law is the same for all of us.

295
00:41:15,033 --> 00:41:16,732
Those who are not..

296
00:41:17,300 --> 00:41:19,599
A traitor and a degenerate..

297
00:41:19,966 --> 00:41:21,632
Is the same for the law.

298
00:41:23,266 --> 00:41:27,232
Even if their nation, their religion
and their tongue is different..

299
00:41:28,166 --> 00:41:29,965
They are the same for us.

300
00:41:30,833 --> 00:41:31,999
That is why..

301
00:41:32,366 --> 00:41:35,565
Your life, your riches and your family..

302
00:41:36,633 --> 00:41:38,632
Is under my security.

303
00:41:39,233 --> 00:41:41,199
Even if you say so..

304
00:41:41,300 --> 00:41:43,865
Even if you think us the same as one of you..

305
00:41:44,033 --> 00:41:47,932
As you say then, okay.

306
00:41:48,433 --> 00:41:49,465
Thank you.

307
00:41:50,333 --> 00:41:52,465
Now be with your people.

308
00:41:52,900 --> 00:41:54,332
Hear them.

309
00:41:54,433 --> 00:41:58,365
Hear their problems, and tell us in this council.

310
00:41:59,733 --> 00:42:01,199
Don't forget this as well..

311
00:42:01,433 --> 00:42:06,432
You will not be taxed for
any business you do with Byzantine.

312
00:42:09,933 --> 00:42:13,432
And I will protect your caravans...

313
00:42:14,033 --> 00:42:15,832
...to Byzantium.

314
00:42:20,933 --> 00:42:23,032
I hope our business will grow.

315
00:42:24,900 --> 00:42:26,632
Farewell now.

316
00:42:43,666 --> 00:42:45,465
My Bey forgive me, but...

317
00:42:47,133 --> 00:42:49,099
Thank Allah a thousand times...

318
00:42:50,100 --> 00:42:52,299
..we ruined all those Lords.

319
00:42:53,033 --> 00:42:56,065
We went and took
the lands you said and wanted.

320
00:42:57,833 --> 00:42:59,399
But..

321
00:42:59,900 --> 00:43:03,365
What is doing business without gold in Byzantium?

322
00:43:04,433 --> 00:43:06,432
I could not understand it.

323
00:43:07,433 --> 00:43:09,232
Is that so, Bayindir?

324
00:43:10,633 --> 00:43:13,199
Is that so?

325
00:43:14,833 --> 00:43:16,799
You will do that.

326
00:43:18,366 --> 00:43:20,565
You will go to the Constantine.

327
00:43:35,266 --> 00:43:37,765
Osman, who lived in a tent until yesterday...

328
00:43:38,333 --> 00:43:40,332
...set his eyes on our lands.

329
00:43:42,500 --> 00:43:46,565
He and the Turkmens who follow him...

330
00:43:46,900 --> 00:43:48,999
...deserved this punishment.

331
00:43:50,900 --> 00:43:54,965
We cannot send Turks away from our lands
right away when Osman dies, sir.

332
00:43:55,266 --> 00:43:57,599
Osman...
Thank God...

333
00:43:57,833 --> 00:44:00,932
...we will not hear that shepherd's
name here again.

334
00:44:01,266 --> 00:44:02,232
Sir.

335
00:44:03,400 --> 00:44:05,632
Osman damaged Konya...

336
00:44:05,800 --> 00:44:07,299
...as much as he damaged us.

337
00:44:08,266 --> 00:44:11,265
Konya gave the flag itself.

338
00:44:13,966 --> 00:44:15,965
And Osman will die today.

339
00:44:17,533 --> 00:44:21,732
Now Turkmens who settled
on our lands will lose all their hopes.

340
00:44:25,733 --> 00:44:26,965
First, Inegol...

341
00:44:27,933 --> 00:44:32,232
..Bilecik, Sogut and Konya.

342
00:44:35,800 --> 00:44:39,632
We will take every piece of land that Osman steps on.

343
00:44:42,233 --> 00:44:44,699
I swear on Jesus.

344
00:44:48,700 --> 00:44:52,365
My Osman Bey, forgive me but...

345
00:44:53,033 --> 00:44:55,032
...why would that great Emperor...

346
00:44:55,233 --> 00:44:58,065
...hear the words of a poor man like me?

347
00:44:58,833 --> 00:45:00,799
Go and see him there.

348
00:45:02,066 --> 00:45:05,232
He might not be that great, huh?

349
00:45:08,633 --> 00:45:10,832
Don't you always cloud the issue?

350
00:45:11,233 --> 00:45:14,832
Didn't you save your head
with your tongue for many times?

351
00:45:16,900 --> 00:45:20,065
Don't worry. This duty...

352
00:45:21,933 --> 00:45:23,832
...suits you the best.

353
00:45:26,066 --> 00:45:28,399
We can sacrifice our lives for the cause.

354
00:45:28,900 --> 00:45:32,232
I see that our Osman Bey...

355
00:45:32,633 --> 00:45:36,032
...is prepared to sacrifice this poor man's head...

356
00:45:37,100 --> 00:45:40,165
...it is the order of our Bey. We'll do as he says.

357
00:45:41,866 --> 00:45:43,699
There is a law of war.

358
00:45:44,533 --> 00:45:47,399
They came to wash our lands with blood.

359
00:45:49,566 --> 00:45:51,432
And they lost.

360
00:45:52,466 --> 00:45:54,765
There will be a price, of course.

361
00:45:56,566 --> 00:46:00,299
Whoever will trade with our people in Byzantium...

362
00:46:01,133 --> 00:46:03,932
...will not give gold in any way.

363
00:46:05,733 --> 00:46:07,665
And the Emperor Andronikos...

364
00:46:07,833 --> 00:46:10,332
...will ensure their safety.

365
00:46:11,033 --> 00:46:12,765
Bayindir...

366
00:46:14,633 --> 00:46:17,232
You will make him accept this.

367
00:46:18,766 --> 00:46:20,799
Yes my Bey.

368
00:46:21,833 --> 00:46:24,932
But you will not go there as the messenger of a tribe...

369
00:46:25,900 --> 00:46:29,365
...you will be the messenger of an independent Beylic.

370
00:46:29,500 --> 00:46:32,365
Emperor Andronikos will understand that...

371
00:46:33,266 --> 00:46:35,765
...we are an independent Beylic...

372
00:46:37,066 --> 00:46:39,332
...that depends on no one.

373
00:46:49,000 --> 00:46:51,432
-It is time brother.
-That's right.

374
00:46:52,233 --> 00:46:53,765
It's time.

375
00:46:53,833 --> 00:46:56,799
We have been fighting
since my ancestor Ertugrul Gazi.

376
00:46:57,466 --> 00:46:59,399
We have always moved towards them,

377
00:46:59,700 --> 00:47:01,732
they have always attacked us.

378
00:47:02,300 --> 00:47:05,332
We hit their commanders and their lords.

379
00:47:06,066 --> 00:47:09,032
We took their citadels we took their castles.

380
00:47:10,266 --> 00:47:11,665
And then

381
00:47:12,500 --> 00:47:15,199
they faced us with their best armies.

382
00:47:16,366 --> 00:47:19,465
And we ruined them in Bapheus area.

383
00:47:20,900 --> 00:47:22,232
And

384
00:47:22,733 --> 00:47:25,132
we did it all alone.

385
00:47:28,933 --> 00:47:31,532
And as of now

386
00:47:31,900 --> 00:47:35,465
it's our time to declare
that we are an independent Beylik.

387
00:47:38,166 --> 00:47:39,899
-Boran.
-My Bey.

388
00:47:40,233 --> 00:47:41,665
Inform everyone.

389
00:47:42,200 --> 00:47:44,332
Send messengers to all the Beyliks.

390
00:47:45,200 --> 00:47:47,199
Let everyone know that

391
00:47:47,533 --> 00:47:49,532
we are an independent Beylik.

392
00:47:49,900 --> 00:47:51,699
Yes my Bey.

393
00:47:57,666 --> 00:48:00,599
Come on. Let's go to our people

394
00:48:01,266 --> 00:48:03,332
and tell them the good news.

395
00:48:15,733 --> 00:48:18,665
Osman repelled the Byzantium
is that so, Dursun Fakih?

396
00:48:18,833 --> 00:48:20,599
He did, mighty Sultan.

397
00:48:20,833 --> 00:48:23,332
And he did it all alone.

398
00:48:25,666 --> 00:48:27,832
We did as we promised

399
00:48:28,233 --> 00:48:30,732
and we sent the army, Dursun Fakih.

400
00:48:32,133 --> 00:48:33,765
We did, but

401
00:48:35,033 --> 00:48:36,799
forgive me, my Sultan.

402
00:48:39,466 --> 00:48:41,699
Wasn't that our responsibility?

403
00:48:43,666 --> 00:48:45,965
Don't speak in circles

404
00:48:47,200 --> 00:48:49,899
say that you're on the throne thanks to Osman

405
00:48:50,166 --> 00:48:53,499
but you cannot even help him with an army.

406
00:48:53,866 --> 00:48:54,932
Of course not.

407
00:48:55,200 --> 00:48:58,165
I do not hold you responsible for what happened,

408
00:48:58,366 --> 00:48:59,799
but

409
00:49:00,633 --> 00:49:03,999
but Osman Bey is destroying the infidels all alone.

410
00:49:04,633 --> 00:49:06,232
He is the hope of Turkmens.

411
00:49:07,166 --> 00:49:09,132
Don't you think

412
00:49:09,300 --> 00:49:13,765
it is time for him to declare that
he is an independent Bey with your warrant?

413
00:49:16,133 --> 00:49:17,832
So you're trying to say that

414
00:49:18,833 --> 00:49:22,699
Osman should break his connection with Konya.

415
00:49:26,133 --> 00:49:28,665
This will only divide us.

416
00:49:49,000 --> 00:49:50,065
Show respect.

417
00:49:52,366 --> 00:49:53,965
Commander. Show respect.

418
00:49:54,200 --> 00:49:56,599
We show respect to Tabriz.

419
00:49:58,266 --> 00:49:59,599
Not to Konya.

420
00:50:02,933 --> 00:50:06,932
The amount of tax
we will collect from your merchants...

421
00:50:07,366 --> 00:50:08,865
..is written here.

422
00:50:10,066 --> 00:50:12,332
Sultan Mesud will..

423
00:50:13,000 --> 00:50:14,399
...impress his seal.

424
00:50:14,933 --> 00:50:18,332
Merchants will not be able to object.

425
00:50:20,866 --> 00:50:24,632
If you enter this door like this again...

426
00:50:25,800 --> 00:50:27,965
...you will not even have the tongue...

427
00:50:28,333 --> 00:50:30,599
...to ask permission from Tabriz.

428
00:51:04,233 --> 00:51:07,265
Turk-Islam state under the shadow of Mongols.

429
00:51:08,066 --> 00:51:10,199
Seljuk State.

430
00:51:11,466 --> 00:51:12,965
Konya.

431
00:51:16,700 --> 00:51:18,665
Ha, Dursun Faqih?

432
00:51:20,733 --> 00:51:24,165
When our reputation, which our ancestors glorified...

433
00:51:25,200 --> 00:51:29,265
...is down here, what are you talking
about Sultan? you ask, right?

434
00:51:29,800 --> 00:51:33,132
I'd behead him here if it wouldn't harm...

435
00:51:33,633 --> 00:51:35,199
...all the people.

436
00:51:36,133 --> 00:51:38,465
But the situation is clear, my Sultan.

437
00:51:39,766 --> 00:51:41,932
While our hands are tied..

438
00:51:42,133 --> 00:51:47,232
...Osman Bey's victories increase
Turk's reputation and hope.

439
00:51:49,300 --> 00:51:50,932
We cannot ignore this.

440
00:51:51,533 --> 00:51:54,032
There's no point in trying more, huh?

441
00:51:55,100 --> 00:51:56,965
Astagfurullah Sultan Hadhrat.

442
00:51:57,633 --> 00:52:00,632
But if the candle is blew out somewhere...

443
00:52:00,933 --> 00:52:02,932
...it gives its fire to somewhere else.

444
00:52:04,066 --> 00:52:06,599
The khutbah you will recite for Osman Bey...

445
00:52:06,800 --> 00:52:09,065
...will befit your dignity.

446
00:52:20,400 --> 00:52:22,132
Being blind to the truth...

447
00:52:22,800 --> 00:52:24,599
...is the biggest cruelty.

448
00:52:25,766 --> 00:52:27,932
You are right, Dursun Faqih.

449
00:52:29,133 --> 00:52:31,732
Send news to ulamas you trust the most.

450
00:52:32,533 --> 00:52:34,132
They should get ready.

451
00:52:34,800 --> 00:52:36,899
I want to see them tomorrow in my palace.

452
00:52:39,033 --> 00:52:40,932
Yes, Hadhrat Sultan.

453
00:53:53,800 --> 00:53:57,365
Great Pope, the leader of Christians...

454
00:53:58,733 --> 00:54:00,432
...Byzantium is defeated.

455
00:54:00,733 --> 00:54:02,865
The cross is defeated.

456
00:54:05,233 --> 00:54:07,032
The Emperor is a coward.

457
00:54:07,833 --> 00:54:10,365
Commanders are idiot.

458
00:54:11,133 --> 00:54:13,532
Lords do not know how to fight.

459
00:54:14,700 --> 00:54:16,799
Soldiers don't have faith.

460
00:54:17,366 --> 00:54:19,965
The fear of asking help from Catholics...

461
00:54:20,266 --> 00:54:23,265
...made us lose against Turks.

462
00:54:23,833 --> 00:54:26,499
I am begging you, dear Pope.

463
00:54:26,800 --> 00:54:29,965
The cross that fell must rise again.

464
00:54:30,666 --> 00:54:33,465
Our lands in the east are suffering.

465
00:54:35,066 --> 00:54:38,132
Barbarians are invading our noble homeland.

466
00:54:38,333 --> 00:54:41,232
The cross is giving the sky to the crescent.

467
00:54:43,000 --> 00:54:44,432
Preventing this...

468
00:54:44,633 --> 00:54:47,532
...is the most important duty of every Christian.

469
00:54:48,233 --> 00:54:51,099
Christians' protector, sacred Pope.

470
00:54:51,366 --> 00:54:54,332
Send a big crusaders army to these lands.

471
00:54:55,400 --> 00:54:58,365
As Commander Mouzalon I promise you.

472
00:54:59,266 --> 00:55:02,032
I will kill all your enemies.

473
00:55:08,133 --> 00:55:09,965
O, The Tenacious!

474
00:55:10,433 --> 00:55:13,165
O, The Opener, my Allah..

475
00:55:14,100 --> 00:55:15,132
My Allah..

476
00:55:16,366 --> 00:55:18,332
We thank You, my Allah.

477
00:55:18,966 --> 00:55:20,565
Thank You..

478
00:55:20,933 --> 00:55:24,165
...You granted us with a glorious victory.

479
00:55:25,066 --> 00:55:26,099
My Allah...

480
00:55:27,266 --> 00:55:30,832
Now grant me with doing justice
to this glorious victory.

481
00:55:31,833 --> 00:55:33,832
Let me rule with justice...

482
00:55:34,100 --> 00:55:36,465
...let me fly the flag of Islam...

483
00:55:36,933 --> 00:55:38,765
...everywhere in the world...

484
00:55:39,066 --> 00:55:41,965
...to give the poor what they deserve.

485
00:55:43,533 --> 00:55:44,832
My Allah..

486
00:55:46,266 --> 00:55:49,699
The ways of Your cause never end.

487
00:55:50,333 --> 00:55:52,432
There are still many of them.

488
00:55:53,266 --> 00:55:54,499
But..

489
00:55:55,433 --> 00:55:57,599
..but our case...

490
00:55:59,266 --> 00:56:00,965
..is The Red Apple.
(Turkish legend symboling the ultimate goal of conquest)

491
00:56:01,566 --> 00:56:03,965
My Allah... To reach there...

492
00:56:05,500 --> 00:56:08,199
...give us strength, my Allah...

493
00:56:08,966 --> 00:56:13,532
Amen... Amen, my Allah..

494
00:56:14,633 --> 00:56:17,099
Amen..

495
00:56:35,566 --> 00:56:36,999
Boran Alp!

496
00:56:42,666 --> 00:56:44,865
Are you running away from me?

497
00:56:46,433 --> 00:56:49,665
No, why would I run away from you?

498
00:56:49,733 --> 00:56:52,699
My Bey might order me something
I should check on him.

499
00:56:52,833 --> 00:56:54,265
No.

500
00:56:56,166 --> 00:56:57,365
You're running away.

501
00:56:58,333 --> 00:57:02,532
You're running away from me since you
protected me during the battle.

502
00:57:03,266 --> 00:57:05,065
About that.

503
00:57:05,666 --> 00:57:08,165
Right, about that.

504
00:57:10,333 --> 00:57:13,465
Didn't I tell you that do not risk your life for me?

505
00:57:13,966 --> 00:57:17,265
-Why would you still...
-How can a human stop this, Esrigun Hatun?

506
00:57:21,933 --> 00:57:23,532
I understood that

507
00:57:24,166 --> 00:57:27,399
if you are hurt,

508
00:57:28,400 --> 00:57:30,332
it hurts me more.

509
00:57:45,666 --> 00:57:50,132
Boran brother, come on brother. Brother.

510
00:57:51,400 --> 00:57:53,565
Come on brother.

511
00:58:18,000 --> 00:58:22,265
O' ulema who taught the spirit and
mind of the people of Seljuks.

512
00:58:24,633 --> 00:58:27,599
Now it is your turn for the conquest.

513
00:58:28,100 --> 00:58:30,999
But this will not be like others.

514
00:58:32,066 --> 00:58:33,732
This journey will be like

515
00:58:34,100 --> 00:58:37,032
Eyup Ensari's journey to Constantinople.

516
00:58:38,266 --> 00:58:39,632
From now on

517
00:58:40,200 --> 00:58:43,165
you will spend your life behind Osman Bey.

518
00:58:47,600 --> 00:58:49,432
We saw it with our own eyes.

519
00:58:50,833 --> 00:58:54,032
The light went out here.

520
00:58:55,066 --> 00:59:00,665
For those who always seek expeditions, the paths
are always like the gates of Heaven, my Sultan.

521
00:59:01,833 --> 00:59:03,865
We planted many seeds in Konya

522
00:59:04,433 --> 00:59:08,365
now it is time to plant them in Sogut, in Yenisehir

523
00:59:09,033 --> 00:59:13,099
and even Bursa, and time to revive them.

524
00:59:15,900 --> 00:59:20,065
This is your duty and your goal, Dursun Fakih.

525
00:59:23,133 --> 00:59:26,232
As Osman Bey carries the banner all over the world.

526
00:59:27,366 --> 00:59:29,199
you will prosper the Beylik

527
00:59:29,466 --> 00:59:31,732
which he built.

528
00:59:33,600 --> 00:59:36,632
If one side of Seljuks is science,

529
00:59:37,133 --> 00:59:39,399
the other side is knowledge.

530
00:59:39,933 --> 00:59:41,999
If its one post is ulema,

531
00:59:42,666 --> 00:59:45,165
the other one is saints.

532
00:59:46,466 --> 00:59:49,532
Now it is time to be the wings of

533
00:59:50,066 --> 00:59:51,865
Osman Bey's Beylik.

534
00:59:55,533 --> 00:59:57,465
Also

535
00:59:58,566 --> 01:00:00,832
after tonight,

536
01:00:01,366 --> 01:00:04,032
all the khutbah will be delivered

537
01:00:04,366 --> 01:00:07,065
in the name of Osman Bey, not me.

538
01:00:10,233 --> 01:00:13,365
This is Sultan Mesut's verdict.

539
01:00:16,366 --> 01:00:18,099
Let them know, Dursun Fakih.

540
01:00:18,533 --> 01:00:20,365
Yes, my Sultan.

541
01:00:20,933 --> 01:00:22,765
We will let them know.

542
01:00:23,733 --> 01:00:27,165
-Have a safe journey.
-Amen.

543
01:01:04,266 --> 01:01:06,165
Orhan.

544
01:01:13,933 --> 01:01:15,832
What happened son?

545
01:01:21,666 --> 01:01:23,299
Son?

546
01:01:24,066 --> 01:01:27,532
Even the best hunters might lose their prey.

547
01:01:27,900 --> 01:01:30,199
Don't worry.

548
01:01:32,400 --> 01:01:34,232
I know, but

549
01:01:35,733 --> 01:01:38,565
I was sure that I was going to catch Valens, father.

550
01:01:39,000 --> 01:01:43,232
If I had killed them, the martyrs
would have been resting in comfort now.

551
01:01:43,833 --> 01:01:45,865
But I couldn't do it father.

552
01:01:47,266 --> 01:01:48,532
I couldn't.

553
01:01:49,500 --> 01:01:52,899
Son, look at me.

554
01:01:53,366 --> 01:01:55,232
That dastard ran away for now.

555
01:01:55,533 --> 01:01:58,332
But, about the martyrs.

556
01:02:00,666 --> 01:02:03,132
When we declare our independence

557
01:02:03,966 --> 01:02:06,765
all of them will rest in peace, don't worry.

558
01:02:08,733 --> 01:02:10,899
Their end will eventually come.

559
01:02:11,566 --> 01:02:14,365
It will, don't worry son.

560
01:02:14,700 --> 01:02:18,299
But now it is time for us to tell our
independence to the people.

561
01:02:18,866 --> 01:02:20,432
Let all of them know

562
01:02:20,633 --> 01:02:23,032
that they belong to an independent Beylik.

563
01:02:24,633 --> 01:02:25,865
My Bey!

564
01:02:30,266 --> 01:02:32,565
We have news from Sultan Mesut, my Bey.

565
01:02:52,000 --> 01:02:53,632
Praise be!

566
01:02:54,866 --> 01:02:56,799
Praise be, Sultan Mesut.

567
01:02:57,700 --> 01:02:59,199
Thank you.

568
01:03:00,233 --> 01:03:01,599
What does he say, my Bey?

569
01:03:02,566 --> 01:03:04,599
Oh, son.

570
01:03:06,333 --> 01:03:10,499
He gave us the good news.

571
01:03:11,833 --> 01:03:13,265
From now on

572
01:03:13,866 --> 01:03:16,599
we have received the news we've been waiting for.

573
01:03:27,566 --> 01:03:29,365
Commander Tatius.

574
01:03:29,566 --> 01:03:30,899
Why are you in a hurry?

575
01:03:31,200 --> 01:03:33,699
I've brought important news for Lord Valens.

576
01:03:33,700 --> 01:03:35,232
What's this important news?

577
01:03:35,300 --> 01:03:37,265
We got news from our spies in Konya.

578
01:03:37,333 --> 01:03:40,932
A group of people that contains
wise men will set out to see Osman.

579
01:03:40,933 --> 01:03:44,165
That group shall never arrive get the soldiers ready.

580
01:03:44,500 --> 01:03:47,732
It shouldn't be so crowded just pick the best ones.

581
01:03:47,866 --> 01:03:49,665
We will destroy them.

582
01:03:49,866 --> 01:03:52,032
Won't we let the Lord know about it?

583
01:03:52,433 --> 01:03:53,899
No.

584
01:03:54,233 --> 01:03:58,065
We don't need the Lord and a huge army
to choke them in their own blood.

585
01:03:59,933 --> 01:04:01,299
Come on.

586
01:04:04,000 --> 01:04:07,532
We have a long way ahead but it is pretty beautiful.

587
01:04:08,733 --> 01:04:10,499
We will teach a word

588
01:04:11,100 --> 01:04:12,899
and every word we teach

589
01:04:13,200 --> 01:04:15,265
will turn into a lot of sentences.

590
01:04:16,166 --> 01:04:19,665
-The Frontiers will be the cradle of science.
-Amen.

591
01:04:20,366 --> 01:04:22,532
The fire we set in Konya

592
01:04:23,466 --> 01:04:26,499
will flare up in Osman Bey's Beylik,
if Allah permits!

593
01:04:27,233 --> 01:04:28,832
if Allah permits!

594
01:04:43,166 --> 01:04:45,699
Osman Bey's brave Alps'

595
01:04:45,700 --> 01:04:47,765
Praise be!
Praise be!

596
01:04:48,233 --> 01:04:50,665
So, at this rate wouldn't leave.

597
01:04:50,900 --> 01:04:54,965
An infidel land, you would add them into ours.

598
01:04:57,066 --> 01:04:59,632
Thank you, Kara Ebe, thank you.

599
01:05:03,700 --> 01:05:05,065
-Groom.
-Mother.

600
01:05:06,500 --> 01:05:09,199
Take Gurbuz and feed him alright?

601
01:05:09,266 --> 01:05:11,232
Mother.

602
01:05:11,800 --> 01:05:16,332
Gurbuz is full, and he doesn't like grass, he likes meat.

603
01:05:17,066 --> 01:05:19,132
Cerkutay.

604
01:05:21,333 --> 01:05:24,665
Are you mad? I am not talking about that Gurbuz.

605
01:05:25,566 --> 01:05:27,565
I am talking about this Gurbuz.

606
01:05:34,533 --> 01:05:38,332
You stubborn goat who ate my flowers.

607
01:05:41,433 --> 01:05:45,565
Mother, I have just came back
from the battle, don't do this.

608
01:05:45,666 --> 01:05:48,399
Alps, do you see this?

609
01:05:48,600 --> 01:05:51,899
He calls me mother, and doesn't do what I say.

610
01:05:52,033 --> 01:05:54,499
You have no heart.

611
01:05:54,800 --> 01:05:58,399
With this old age and my aching legs..

612
01:05:58,600 --> 01:06:00,899
With this pain in my waist.

613
01:06:01,666 --> 01:06:05,665
Cerkutay, don't do this. She is tired as you can see.

614
01:06:06,066 --> 01:06:09,065
What would happen
if you take Gurbuz to feed anyways?

615
01:06:09,266 --> 01:06:11,065
Don't do this brother.

616
01:06:11,100 --> 01:06:13,732
You have no heart, Cerkutay.

617
01:06:14,133 --> 01:06:17,199
He will do it mother hand him the goat.

618
01:06:19,733 --> 01:06:21,065
Here.

619
01:06:22,433 --> 01:06:25,332
Now you regret giving that goat my name.

620
01:06:34,833 --> 01:06:36,832
I got it.

621
01:06:37,866 --> 01:06:39,532
Well done groom.

622
01:06:39,966 --> 01:06:43,832
Look at me, take good care of it.

623
01:06:44,266 --> 01:06:45,999
Do not let anything happen to it.

624
01:06:46,233 --> 01:06:47,432
No, mother.

625
01:06:47,666 --> 01:06:50,932
My Gurbuz, my goat.

626
01:06:51,133 --> 01:06:53,699
Look, eat well okay?

627
01:06:54,500 --> 01:06:57,932
Well done my valiant.

628
01:07:02,000 --> 01:07:03,799
Alright then.

629
01:07:08,466 --> 01:07:10,765
Why did I even get this.

630
01:07:12,333 --> 01:07:14,799
She loves this goat more than me.

631
01:07:17,866 --> 01:07:20,665
Gur buz brother, Bey is waiting for us.

632
01:07:21,633 --> 01:07:24,365
We will head to Osman Bey.

633
01:07:26,266 --> 01:07:29,532
And Cerkutay is off to feeding, let us go.

634
01:07:29,800 --> 01:07:30,532
Where?

635
01:07:31,166 --> 01:07:33,265
-Come on Cerkutay.
-Boran

636
01:07:33,666 --> 01:07:35,932
Come on Cerkutay, to feeding.

637
01:07:35,966 --> 01:07:38,765
-To feeding.
-Come on brother.

638
01:07:38,866 --> 01:07:40,232
Gurbuz.

639
01:07:40,300 --> 01:07:42,432
Where to? I will not leave Bey alone.

640
01:07:42,566 --> 01:07:45,032
Boran don't go.

641
01:07:49,433 --> 01:07:51,132
What will I do now?

642
01:07:51,866 --> 01:07:54,032
Ah Cerkutay, ah!

643
01:07:59,866 --> 01:08:01,265
Alps!

644
01:08:05,200 --> 01:08:08,099
-To whom do these belong to?
-To Osman Bey, Cerkutay Alp.

645
01:08:09,600 --> 01:08:11,532
Then..

646
01:08:12,233 --> 01:08:13,999
Take this.

647
01:08:14,733 --> 01:08:16,332
Here.

648
01:08:17,433 --> 01:08:18,564
Come on.

649
01:08:18,832 --> 01:08:19,932
Come on.

650
01:08:20,466 --> 01:08:22,332
Come on.

651
01:08:27,466 --> 01:08:29,999
Didn't they tell us to slaughter two goats?

652
01:08:30,133 --> 01:08:32,332
That is what I know as well, brother.

653
01:08:33,100 --> 01:08:35,064
-Let us go then.
-Come on.

654
01:08:56,332 --> 01:08:58,465
So you are a messenger of Osman Bey.

655
01:09:02,500 --> 01:09:06,599
After destroying my army, and conquering my forts..

656
01:09:07,433 --> 01:09:09,832
Did you come here to beg for his life?

657
01:09:10,332 --> 01:09:12,232
The Almighty Emperor.

658
01:09:12,966 --> 01:09:15,665
As you said.

659
01:09:16,233 --> 01:09:18,698
Why would The Mighty Osman Bey..

660
01:09:18,966 --> 01:09:23,165
...who defeated your armies..

661
01:09:23,433 --> 01:09:25,532
...who took what he wanted
whenever he wanted to..

662
01:09:25,832 --> 01:09:28,799
...beg for mercy from you?

663
01:09:30,233 --> 01:09:32,265
Osman thinks he won?

664
01:09:32,533 --> 01:09:34,198
Not at all.

665
01:09:34,433 --> 01:09:36,332
The Almighty Emperor.

666
01:09:36,733 --> 01:09:39,532
Why would anyone "think" that?

667
01:09:40,733 --> 01:09:44,332
It is a fact that Osman Bey has won.

668
01:09:44,933 --> 01:09:48,999
If you're not going to beg for mercy,
then why are you here messenger?

669
01:09:49,566 --> 01:09:51,465
For the agreement..

670
01:09:51,733 --> 01:09:54,865
That Osman Bey will give to you.

671
01:09:57,366 --> 01:09:58,665
What agreement?

672
01:09:59,233 --> 01:10:00,832
From now on.

673
01:10:01,166 --> 01:10:04,365
Even if muslim or not..

674
01:10:04,900 --> 01:10:07,532
Any merchant from our people..

675
01:10:07,733 --> 01:10:10,832
Will not pay a toll..

676
01:10:11,333 --> 01:10:13,899
While doing business in your land.

677
01:10:14,666 --> 01:10:18,332
They will do their business freely in your lands.

678
01:10:18,866 --> 01:10:20,699
With that, you..

679
01:10:21,566 --> 01:10:24,999
Will pay for two of tenth worth of your caravans..

680
01:10:25,400 --> 01:10:29,199
When they enter our lands..

681
01:10:29,333 --> 01:10:32,599
To Osman Bey as tax.

682
01:10:43,700 --> 01:10:45,965
These are the words of Osman.

683
01:10:47,900 --> 01:10:49,499
Look at that shepherd Osman.

684
01:10:50,166 --> 01:10:52,365
Emperor Andronikos.

685
01:10:52,933 --> 01:10:54,765
You do not have the messenger..

686
01:10:54,966 --> 01:10:57,399
Of shepherd Osman in front of you.

687
01:10:57,866 --> 01:11:01,465
And not even the messenger of..

688
01:11:01,866 --> 01:11:03,932
Seljuk State's margrave Osman Bey.

689
01:11:05,000 --> 01:11:09,199
Now, you have the messenger of..

690
01:11:09,966 --> 01:11:12,532
Osman Bey, who does not answer to anyone..

691
01:11:12,900 --> 01:11:17,032
Who is the only ruler of his lands, the ruler
of free people, Osman Bey.

692
01:11:18,933 --> 01:11:22,399
You better speak knowing who you are speaking with.

693
01:11:34,166 --> 01:11:36,599
Make way, Osman Bey.

694
01:11:43,900 --> 01:11:46,065
Osman Bey is here.

695
01:12:04,566 --> 01:12:06,465
Thank you.

696
01:12:06,800 --> 01:12:07,965
Thank you.

697
01:12:14,533 --> 01:12:17,265
Thank you.
Live long!

698
01:12:17,833 --> 01:12:19,999
Thank you. Thank you.

699
01:12:22,633 --> 01:12:23,865
We..

700
01:12:25,166 --> 01:12:27,699
...did everything we said until now.

701
01:12:28,366 --> 01:12:31,799
But we did all those things...

702
01:12:32,766 --> 01:12:34,432
..thanks to you.

703
01:12:39,000 --> 01:12:41,932
Our ancestors rode their horses to these lands.

704
01:12:42,566 --> 01:12:46,399
Their intention was to turn these
ands into their homeland.

705
01:12:47,266 --> 01:12:50,732
And we turned it into our homeland,
thank Allah.

706
01:12:58,533 --> 01:13:00,532
First, we started with a tribe.

707
01:13:01,066 --> 01:13:04,932
Then we gathered our tribes, we grew..

708
01:13:06,133 --> 01:13:07,999
..but as we grew..

709
01:13:08,833 --> 01:13:11,332
...the Byzantium always tried to attack us.

710
01:13:11,933 --> 01:13:13,132
But..

711
01:13:13,400 --> 01:13:16,965
...we defeated them at Bapheus alone.

712
01:13:18,533 --> 01:13:21,165
On this cause we set out..

713
01:13:21,733 --> 01:13:24,865
...with 200 tents, we took thousands of tents...

714
01:13:25,300 --> 01:13:26,932
..tens of castles.

715
01:13:35,633 --> 01:13:36,965
May Allah bless you.

716
01:13:38,033 --> 01:13:39,399
May Allah bless you.

717
01:13:40,733 --> 01:13:43,599
Of course there was going to be a reward...

718
01:13:43,833 --> 01:13:46,465
...for all the trouble, problems and torment.

719
01:13:47,533 --> 01:13:49,299
Now we sent our messenger...

720
01:13:50,433 --> 01:13:51,999
.. to Byzantium.

721
01:13:52,733 --> 01:13:54,699
We will make an agreement with them.

722
01:13:55,866 --> 01:13:57,132
From now on..

723
01:13:57,500 --> 01:13:59,832
...you will not give any gold..

724
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:02,532
...when you are doing business with Byzantium.

725
01:14:02,733 --> 01:14:05,899
Thus, the goods you sell will be cheaper...

726
01:14:06,300 --> 01:14:08,765
..and your business will grow.

727
01:14:08,933 --> 01:14:12,432
May Allah bless you!

728
01:14:16,733 --> 01:14:18,899
Now, let's talk about the other issue.

729
01:14:20,466 --> 01:14:21,932
From now on..

730
01:14:23,233 --> 01:14:24,965
..khutbahs..

731
01:14:26,333 --> 01:14:28,365
..will be recited in our name.

732
01:14:29,500 --> 01:14:31,932
My Bey! What will Sultan Mesud say to this?

733
01:14:32,900 --> 01:14:34,999
Khutbahs were recited for him!

734
01:14:36,866 --> 01:14:39,232
No... Don't worry.

735
01:14:39,500 --> 01:14:42,599
Sultan Mesud knows this..

736
01:14:43,266 --> 01:14:45,599
...and he even consents to this.

737
01:14:46,100 --> 01:14:48,432
Thus, now...

738
01:14:48,933 --> 01:14:53,165
...he is sending the most talented scholars,
judges and teachers.

739
01:14:54,166 --> 01:14:55,732
And thus...

740
01:14:55,933 --> 01:14:58,999
...first, we will establish madrasas.
Then...

741
01:14:59,666 --> 01:15:01,932
...we will place judges in every fortresses.

742
01:15:02,533 --> 01:15:04,199
And scholars...

743
01:15:04,833 --> 01:15:06,165
..scholars will..

744
01:15:06,466 --> 01:15:08,432
...answer all of your questions.

745
01:15:08,566 --> 01:15:11,199
Don't worry. There won't be a problem.

746
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:14,865
And business... Our business will grow...

747
01:15:15,000 --> 01:15:17,665
...it will rise and if Allah permits...

748
01:15:17,933 --> 01:15:19,732
-...it will be blessed.
-if Allah permits.

749
01:15:29,000 --> 01:15:32,832
May Allah bless you Osman Bey!

750
01:15:33,566 --> 01:15:36,132
Now it is time to share the trophy of Bapheus.

751
01:15:36,700 --> 01:15:37,999
Come on Alps!

752
01:15:38,400 --> 01:15:40,832
Share the trophy with our people.

753
01:15:45,766 --> 01:15:47,565
O, people...

754
01:15:49,066 --> 01:15:50,099
Now..

755
01:15:51,433 --> 01:15:53,565
..we will become an independent Beylic!

756
01:15:56,500 --> 01:15:59,165
Now... send the good news to everywhere!

757
01:15:59,733 --> 01:16:02,632
To all Beylics! To all tribes!

758
01:16:02,800 --> 01:16:03,899
Tell everyone!

759
01:16:04,833 --> 01:16:07,832
I will be waiting for everyone to Sogut tonight.

760
01:16:11,466 --> 01:16:12,965
Thank you.

761
01:16:13,666 --> 01:16:14,932
Thank you too.

762
01:16:15,333 --> 01:16:17,265
May Allah bless you too.

763
01:16:18,133 --> 01:16:19,599
May Allah bless you too.

764
01:16:29,633 --> 01:16:32,632
You will pay for this impudency, messenger.

765
01:16:33,933 --> 01:16:35,565
Emperor Andronikos.

766
01:16:35,833 --> 01:16:39,332
Even if you take my head now
it will not change the truth.

767
01:16:39,700 --> 01:16:41,932
You were defeated! Right!

768
01:16:42,233 --> 01:16:45,265
If you cannot agree I will die here.

769
01:16:45,533 --> 01:16:48,899
But... all your people will die with me!

770
01:16:49,433 --> 01:16:51,032
Why is that?

771
01:16:56,300 --> 01:16:59,565
If you allow me. I'll tell you.

772
01:17:01,166 --> 01:17:02,432
Let him.

773
01:17:03,533 --> 01:17:06,032
Let him waste his last breath for this.

774
01:17:09,533 --> 01:17:11,899
Be careful, Emperor.

775
01:17:13,933 --> 01:17:15,432
Don't be scared.

776
01:17:15,933 --> 01:17:19,032
Are you even scared of the Turks' map?

777
01:17:31,700 --> 01:17:33,565
Look, Emperor.

778
01:17:34,166 --> 01:17:38,665
These are the lands ruled by my Osman Bey.

779
01:17:39,800 --> 01:17:41,699
And that means..

780
01:17:42,000 --> 01:17:45,265
..your traders and caravans...

781
01:17:46,700 --> 01:17:50,732
...have to step on our lands to do business.

782
01:17:52,133 --> 01:17:53,999
Your wheat trade..

783
01:17:55,000 --> 01:17:56,965
..is under our control.

784
01:17:59,033 --> 01:18:01,332
I am talking about wheat, Emperor.

785
01:18:01,733 --> 01:18:04,632
I am talking about bread and food.

786
01:18:06,500 --> 01:18:09,165
Your warehouses are empty!

787
01:18:09,766 --> 01:18:12,899
Without the caravans that will come from the east...

788
01:18:13,733 --> 01:18:17,732
...all your people will die of hunger!

789
01:18:19,933 --> 01:18:24,099
If you are going to say "I'll bring it with ships."...

790
01:18:25,333 --> 01:18:26,832
..then..

791
01:18:29,400 --> 01:18:31,365
...we will stop them with Karasi Bey.

792
01:18:33,000 --> 01:18:35,065
Now, Emperor...

793
01:18:36,233 --> 01:18:39,299
...if we agree here and if I go back...

794
01:18:39,966 --> 01:18:44,365
...you will pay your tax,
take your goods and do your trade.

795
01:18:45,133 --> 01:18:48,899
If you insist on taking my head...

796
01:18:50,700 --> 01:18:52,299
..I assure you..

797
01:18:52,966 --> 01:18:54,665
...I can sacrifice it for my lands.

798
01:18:55,400 --> 01:18:57,532
If you cut my head off...

799
01:18:58,300 --> 01:19:01,065
..I swear to Allah..

800
01:19:02,200 --> 01:19:04,332
...not a single caravan...

801
01:19:05,333 --> 01:19:08,032
...will arrive in the Constantine.

802
01:19:24,633 --> 01:19:26,232
Not two of tenth.

803
01:19:27,233 --> 01:19:29,299
-One of tenth.
-No.

804
01:19:29,866 --> 01:19:31,665
Allah forbid.

805
01:19:32,933 --> 01:19:36,032
There is no backing up in Osman Bey's matters.

806
01:19:37,100 --> 01:19:40,565
Between you and me, he is very headstrong.

807
01:19:42,800 --> 01:19:45,099
Otherwise..

808
01:19:47,066 --> 01:19:50,265
Here is my head, Emperor.

809
01:19:51,933 --> 01:19:53,832
This head..

810
01:19:54,500 --> 01:19:57,132
In return of your own people.

811
01:20:14,566 --> 01:20:16,165
Bring the clerk.

812
01:20:19,700 --> 01:20:22,332
Elhamdulillah.

813
01:20:23,133 --> 01:20:24,765
Bey.

814
01:20:25,000 --> 01:20:27,265
Thank Allah.

815
01:20:46,433 --> 01:20:49,932
We will send the heads of those who left from Konya.

816
01:20:50,200 --> 01:20:53,765
Turks will see that our swords are so close to them.

817
01:20:54,833 --> 01:20:57,732
Commander Tatius, I don't want any setbacks.

818
01:20:58,000 --> 01:21:00,732
Our spies are watching every step of the caravan.

819
01:21:01,000 --> 01:21:04,032
-They are going to your death. -Let them come.

820
01:21:04,700 --> 01:21:07,165
We will show them the ending they deserve.

821
01:21:07,333 --> 01:21:10,332
We will wash our swords with their blood.

822
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:16,199
Aktemur.

823
01:21:16,766 --> 01:21:19,865
It is your duty to welcome
those who come from Konya.

824
01:21:20,533 --> 01:21:22,065
As you command, Bey.

825
01:21:22,233 --> 01:21:23,965
Thank you.
Konur...

826
01:21:24,600 --> 01:21:26,665
This Lord dog is unpredictable.

827
01:21:27,133 --> 01:21:29,265
It is your duty to protect the caravan.

828
01:21:29,500 --> 01:21:32,499
As you command, Bey.
I will protect them at the cost of my life.

829
01:21:32,533 --> 01:21:33,399
Thank you.

830
01:21:34,033 --> 01:21:36,665
Come on Alps, on horses.

831
01:21:37,366 --> 01:21:39,999
As you command, Bey. My sons..

832
01:21:40,466 --> 01:21:43,199
And we will bring feathers to our ancestors.

833
01:21:45,100 --> 01:21:47,099
Let us go.

834
01:22:25,466 --> 01:22:27,565
They are approaching.

835
01:22:29,233 --> 01:22:31,465
We will attack on my command.

836
01:22:35,333 --> 01:22:37,332
Be ready.

837
01:23:02,266 --> 01:23:03,965
What do you think you're doing?

838
01:23:04,633 --> 01:23:07,499
-Get out of our way.
-We will.

839
01:23:07,766 --> 01:23:10,099
After killing you all.

840
01:23:19,433 --> 01:23:23,599
Those who put State of Seljuks against them
are bound to be destroyed.

841
01:23:24,100 --> 01:23:25,532
This is my last warning.

842
01:23:26,500 --> 01:23:27,832
Get out of our way.

843
01:23:28,166 --> 01:23:31,065
You talk a lot. I will get your head first.

844
01:23:31,366 --> 01:23:32,832
Then the people behind you.

845
01:23:33,433 --> 01:23:35,499
They are many, we can not prevail.

846
01:23:35,833 --> 01:23:37,599
We will delay them.

847
01:23:37,966 --> 01:23:40,799
-Run to the forest.
-A Turk running is unheard of.

848
01:23:41,666 --> 01:23:44,899
At the best, we fight to die.

849
01:23:44,933 --> 01:23:46,632
Attack!

850
01:24:10,566 --> 01:24:14,032
Why do they not like all these scholars, brothers?

851
01:24:14,600 --> 01:24:17,865
Osman Bey has put the infidels to the ground.

852
01:24:19,433 --> 01:24:22,432
Now, everyone is behind him.

853
01:24:22,966 --> 01:24:24,232
Thank Allah.

854
01:24:24,700 --> 01:24:25,865
Thank Allah.

855
01:24:26,233 --> 01:24:27,132
Thank Allah.

856
01:24:27,200 --> 01:24:29,765
Grand victories are loud.

857
01:24:30,100 --> 01:24:33,332
They go over seas and mountains.

858
01:24:34,300 --> 01:24:36,699
As people who support Osman Bey grow..

859
01:24:36,700 --> 01:24:38,732
The battles will increase as well.

860
01:24:39,100 --> 01:24:41,665
Islam will exceed borders.

861
01:24:42,766 --> 01:24:43,699
if Allah permits.

862
01:24:44,433 --> 01:24:46,432
What do you think about..

863
01:24:46,466 --> 01:24:49,599
Many scholars coming to our land, Aktemur Bey?

864
01:24:51,000 --> 01:24:52,932
We will be a free beylik soon.

865
01:24:53,200 --> 01:24:55,132
We will establish a new order.

866
01:24:56,333 --> 01:24:59,065
And this will be realized with scholars.

867
01:25:00,966 --> 01:25:02,199
That is why..

868
01:25:02,933 --> 01:25:05,565
The caravan coming from Konya is important.

869
01:25:07,633 --> 01:25:11,165
We will protect them with our lives for the prosperity.

870
01:25:19,500 --> 01:25:22,232
There is no one going or coming from the horizon.

871
01:25:22,433 --> 01:25:24,832
I hope nothing happened to them.

872
01:25:25,400 --> 01:25:28,299
Kutlu, send troops to Konya road.
-Bey.

873
01:25:28,866 --> 01:25:31,732
-Tell them to look for the caravan.
-As you command, Bey.

874
01:25:45,633 --> 01:25:46,699
Aktemur Bey.

875
01:25:46,966 --> 01:25:49,332
Lord's soldiers are going to Konya.

876
01:25:53,000 --> 01:25:55,799
They heard about the group they will attack them.

877
01:25:55,833 --> 01:25:58,232
Then we should be the one who attacks.

878
01:25:58,433 --> 01:26:01,065
Let's get there quickly now,

879
01:26:01,166 --> 01:26:03,465
-and let's ruin their plan!
-We will!

880
01:26:03,966 --> 01:26:06,465
We will not stop until we kill them!

881
01:26:06,533 --> 01:26:07,599
Come on!

882
01:26:22,633 --> 01:26:24,332
Amen.

883
01:26:47,166 --> 01:26:49,332
My father Ertugrul Ghazi,

884
01:26:49,500 --> 01:26:52,532
he spent his life on horseback
with sword in his hand

885
01:26:52,533 --> 01:26:54,199
trying to settle in a land.

886
01:27:02,733 --> 01:27:04,032
We

887
01:27:05,233 --> 01:27:07,899
settled in this land, thank Allah.

888
01:27:12,133 --> 01:27:14,565
This ground in which you are buried,

889
01:27:17,900 --> 01:27:19,932
is now our country.

890
01:27:20,366 --> 01:27:22,665
And without anyone's help.

891
01:27:23,400 --> 01:27:26,432
With Allah's permission,
we broke all of our ties.

892
01:27:27,966 --> 01:27:29,865
We saw that

893
01:27:30,733 --> 01:27:34,065
the one who stays in the shadow cannot have a shadow.

894
01:27:35,033 --> 01:27:37,332
If we stay under someone else's shadow,

895
01:27:38,166 --> 01:27:40,699
how can we be a shadow for the innocent ones?

896
01:27:47,100 --> 01:27:49,399
We took over your holy cause.

897
01:27:50,966 --> 01:27:52,399
We concluded this cause

898
01:27:52,466 --> 01:27:55,932
which holds responsible not for victory
but for the expedition,

899
01:27:56,000 --> 01:27:59,132
with victory, Thank Allah.

900
01:28:00,133 --> 01:28:03,332
And now, with my children

901
01:28:04,666 --> 01:28:08,065
If Allah permits, we will spread
this banner all over the world.

902
01:28:08,366 --> 01:28:12,565
Until the whole world is conquered
we will keep securing order.

903
01:28:14,300 --> 01:28:15,832
Right, children?

904
01:28:26,533 --> 01:28:29,132
You don't have to worry, Ertugrul Bey.

905
01:28:36,033 --> 01:28:37,865
Don't show mercy to anyone!

906
01:28:40,966 --> 01:28:43,499
Kill them all, don't leave anyone alive!

907
01:28:45,766 --> 01:28:47,632
Destroy them all!

908
01:29:41,766 --> 01:29:44,265
The ones who stop Turks lose their heads.

909
01:30:20,233 --> 01:30:22,765
The one who targets my land loses his life!

910
01:30:22,933 --> 01:30:24,599
Don't you know that?

911
01:30:24,666 --> 01:30:28,999
Allah is the greatest!

912
01:30:32,666 --> 01:30:34,565
Defend the wings!

913
01:30:34,700 --> 01:30:37,032
Do not disperse!

914
01:31:29,333 --> 01:31:33,699
My death will not change the prophecy.

915
01:31:35,633 --> 01:31:37,832
We will take back the lands

916
01:31:38,633 --> 01:31:40,499
which belongs to us.

917
01:31:41,033 --> 01:31:44,299
These lands will belong to Turks until the doomsday.

918
01:32:07,033 --> 01:32:08,465
The light of science

919
01:32:08,866 --> 01:32:10,999
spreads fear to the hearts of the enemy.

920
01:32:11,766 --> 01:32:15,299
Infidels intended to put out the light of science.

921
01:32:16,633 --> 01:32:18,232
You arrived on time, brave men.

922
01:32:18,500 --> 01:32:20,932
-Thank you.
-Thank you Dursun Fakih.

923
01:32:22,700 --> 01:32:25,799
The road that is taken
with science ends up with victory.

924
01:32:26,500 --> 01:32:30,332
The land that is taken
with sword is kept with pen, Dursun Fakih.

925
01:32:30,400 --> 01:32:33,199
We will always be the protectors of science.

926
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:35,699
Thank you.
Thank you.

927
01:32:36,400 --> 01:32:37,232
Alps.

928
01:32:37,666 --> 01:32:41,899
The foundations of the new orde
r we will establish will be laid in Sogut.

929
01:32:42,200 --> 01:32:44,199
Let's bury our martyrs and get going.

930
01:32:44,433 --> 01:32:46,932
To Sogut, not only with Ulema,

931
01:32:49,100 --> 01:32:52,065
but we will also go back there
with the heads of infidels.

932
01:32:52,833 --> 01:32:54,999
Thank you. Come on.

933
01:33:03,100 --> 01:33:04,799
Do you see, Alaca?

934
01:33:05,133 --> 01:33:09,432
He called us but now he's late and making us wait.

935
01:33:11,900 --> 01:33:13,799
Oh, Osman Bey.

936
01:33:19,400 --> 01:33:22,265
What can he do? His horse is slow.

937
01:33:29,233 --> 01:33:30,699
I was thinking,

938
01:33:31,000 --> 01:33:34,099
why my ears are ringing right, Iltutan?

939
01:33:34,733 --> 01:33:36,232
Why do you think?

940
01:33:36,333 --> 01:33:39,065
Ask this to the ones
who have been waiting for you.

941
01:33:39,366 --> 01:33:41,099
Where have you been?

942
01:33:41,733 --> 01:33:43,299
With my children

943
01:33:43,800 --> 01:33:45,899
we went to my father for the good news.

944
01:33:46,366 --> 01:33:48,165
I was going to take you too

945
01:33:48,966 --> 01:33:53,065
but you were trying to put Halime to sleep,
so I didn't want to bother you.

946
01:33:53,433 --> 01:33:56,432
All right, tell me, Osman Bey.

947
01:33:56,800 --> 01:34:00,299
Since you have made us wait
and called us all the way here,

948
01:34:00,400 --> 01:34:03,299
I hope it is something worthwhile.

949
01:34:06,333 --> 01:34:07,632
Nothing.

950
01:34:08,333 --> 01:34:10,599
I just wanted to race.

951
01:34:12,266 --> 01:34:15,065
It seems you can't get enough of defeat at all.

952
01:34:15,666 --> 01:34:18,732
Look at you. Look at you.

953
01:34:19,666 --> 01:34:21,399
When did we lose?

954
01:34:21,733 --> 01:34:23,699
You have lost now, you'll see.

955
01:34:24,700 --> 01:34:27,465
Wait a second, wait.

956
01:34:28,533 --> 01:34:29,932
But this race

957
01:34:30,400 --> 01:34:32,965
will be different from the other ones.

958
01:34:33,433 --> 01:34:34,965
Why is that?

959
01:34:35,433 --> 01:34:37,532
You'll see it if you win.

960
01:34:39,233 --> 01:34:41,499
You're making me wonder, is that so?

961
01:34:42,033 --> 01:34:45,499
Alaca, do you hear?
He's making us curious.

962
01:34:45,733 --> 01:34:48,032
Let's win and see, girl.

963
01:34:48,866 --> 01:34:53,265
Iltutan, look at me, we have to win.
Do you hear me?

964
01:34:53,833 --> 01:34:56,832
She's curious, if we lose...

965
01:34:57,033 --> 01:34:59,299
Look at me, let's get this done.

966
01:34:59,566 --> 01:35:01,365
Come on.

967
01:35:03,033 --> 01:35:04,299
O Allah.

968
01:35:12,733 --> 01:35:15,765
-Come on now.
-Come on!

969
01:35:34,866 --> 01:35:38,199
You were a young branch of
a glorious plane tree.

970
01:35:39,033 --> 01:35:42,565
Now you are becoming strong enough
for the trunk of that tree.

971
01:35:42,566 --> 01:35:43,732
You know that, right?

972
01:35:44,400 --> 01:35:46,999
Mother, I know.

973
01:36:19,833 --> 01:36:22,632
It is the memento of your late grandfather.

974
01:36:23,200 --> 01:36:25,332
Let a part of him affect you too.

975
01:36:41,466 --> 01:36:43,232
I'll protect it at all costs.

976
01:36:53,833 --> 01:36:55,632
My brave son.

977
01:36:56,766 --> 01:36:58,432
You carry your father's heart

978
01:36:58,700 --> 01:37:00,199
and his mind.

979
01:37:00,633 --> 01:37:03,932
I know you will protect all the mementos at all costs.

980
01:37:04,800 --> 01:37:06,465
Now Osman Bey

981
01:37:07,100 --> 01:37:10,365
is declaring all over the world
that he is an independent Bey.

982
01:37:11,433 --> 01:37:13,299
When the time comes

983
01:37:13,733 --> 01:37:16,999
both this Beylik and its cause
will be yours.

984
01:37:19,533 --> 01:37:21,065
At that moment

985
01:37:22,233 --> 01:37:26,299
it will be time for you to bear fruits
in your branches that are strong.

986
01:37:27,966 --> 01:37:30,299
In the cause of the name of Allah...

987
01:37:31,566 --> 01:37:35,032
...always have mercy and justice...

988
01:37:36,133 --> 01:37:38,432
...in your heart, son.

989
01:37:38,900 --> 01:37:41,099
Your word is an amulet in my heart, mother.

990
01:37:42,933 --> 01:37:44,199
I'll always bear it.

991
01:37:49,700 --> 01:37:51,765
Your mother will always be here.

992
01:37:52,966 --> 01:37:54,432
Don't forget.

993
01:38:08,933 --> 01:38:12,032
Come on alps, come on. Hurry up, please.

994
01:38:12,833 --> 01:38:15,699
Osman Bey is expecting to see everyone in Sogut.

995
01:38:15,700 --> 01:38:17,732
I don't know how can I make it on time.

996
01:38:17,966 --> 01:38:19,732
Come on Ulgen, we're leaving.

997
01:38:19,933 --> 01:38:22,265
Gather the supplies and follow us.

998
01:38:22,933 --> 01:38:24,599
It's almost over Malhun Hatun.

999
01:38:24,733 --> 01:38:27,099
We will load a few more sacks and we'll set out.

1000
01:38:27,366 --> 01:38:28,665
Thank you.

1001
01:38:28,900 --> 01:38:31,432
Alps, get the horses ready!

1002
01:38:36,400 --> 01:38:38,232
Come on, come on.

1003
01:38:38,433 --> 01:38:41,499
No, no. It's nowhere to be found!

1004
01:38:41,666 --> 01:38:45,132
My Gurbuz is nowhere to be found,
I looked everywhere.

1005
01:38:47,733 --> 01:38:50,732
Do you mean the alp one or goat one?

1006
01:38:54,366 --> 01:38:57,865
Mother, Cerkutay
gave it to alps,

1007
01:38:57,900 --> 01:39:00,432
maybe they're feeding them, it will come back.

1008
01:39:00,433 --> 01:39:01,732
That Cerkutay!

1009
01:39:01,966 --> 01:39:03,865
If he hurts my child even a bit

1010
01:39:03,900 --> 01:39:06,199
you'll see what I'm going to do to him!

1011
01:39:06,266 --> 01:39:10,032
Mother, it's just a goat, why would he hurt it?

1012
01:39:11,400 --> 01:39:14,199
Oh Cerkutay, don't you know my mother?

1013
01:39:16,700 --> 01:39:19,099
-Is it over?
-The car is ready Ulgen Hatun.

1014
01:39:19,566 --> 01:39:20,865
We loaded them.

1015
01:39:20,933 --> 01:39:23,132
Thank you Yagiz Alp. Mother, come on.

1016
01:39:23,133 --> 01:39:25,232
We need to go to Sogut,
we have lots of work to do.

1017
01:39:25,233 --> 01:39:27,365
I said Gurbuz but you keep saying Sogut!

1018
01:39:27,600 --> 01:39:30,165
Right, alps.

1019
01:39:31,333 --> 01:39:35,565
Did you see my child, my Gurbuz, my goat?

1020
01:39:38,966 --> 01:39:40,265
Kara Ebe.

1021
01:39:40,566 --> 01:39:44,932
Are you looking for the big goat that
was taken to Sogut to be slaughtered?

1022
01:39:47,800 --> 01:39:49,465
To be slaughtered?

1023
01:39:53,600 --> 01:39:55,465
Cerkutay!

1024
01:39:55,700 --> 01:39:58,432
Cerkutay! Cerkutay!

1025
01:39:58,700 --> 01:40:02,232
Cerkutay! Cerkutay'

1026
01:41:29,033 --> 01:41:31,732
Praise be, praise be!

1027
01:41:32,533 --> 01:41:34,765
Parise be, my Bala.

1028
01:41:39,133 --> 01:41:40,265
The time is passing

1029
01:41:40,400 --> 01:41:42,965
but you still remember, is that so, Osman Bey?

1030
01:41:43,066 --> 01:41:45,599
Of course I do.

1031
01:41:46,500 --> 01:41:48,765
Do you remember it?

1032
01:41:51,900 --> 01:41:53,465
The time will come

1033
01:41:53,633 --> 01:41:56,965
our tent will be filled with the voice of our children.

1034
01:41:57,766 --> 01:42:01,265
Then the holy state of the Turkish tribes

1035
01:42:01,800 --> 01:42:04,132
that come together, will be established.

1036
01:42:07,500 --> 01:42:10,665
The reputation of the order of
justice and freedom

1037
01:42:11,466 --> 01:42:13,932
will be heard from afar.

1038
01:42:23,000 --> 01:42:27,132
With the women raised by Bala Hatun
and with the soldiers of Osman Bey

1039
01:42:27,600 --> 01:42:29,965
we will plant our banners all over.

1040
01:42:30,666 --> 01:42:33,965
With Allah's permission,
we will see those days my Bala.

1041
01:42:34,200 --> 01:42:36,432
I hope so, Osman.

1042
01:42:45,800 --> 01:42:47,299
My Bala.

1043
01:42:56,700 --> 01:42:59,632
-Osman.
-Come here.

1044
01:43:10,900 --> 01:43:13,132
It looks great.

1045
01:43:14,066 --> 01:43:15,899
It's so pretty.

1046
01:43:16,433 --> 01:43:17,499
It looks well.

1047
01:43:18,100 --> 01:43:20,132
You were always with me in my dreams.

1048
01:43:21,433 --> 01:43:24,199
You haven't broken our vows since the first day.

1049
01:43:24,533 --> 01:43:27,699
You have always supported me with your sisters.

1050
01:43:28,766 --> 01:43:30,332
Thank you.

1051
01:43:38,233 --> 01:43:42,299
I believe in your dreams j
ust as I believed in you, Osman.

1052
01:43:43,700 --> 01:43:46,332
Thankfully all of them
